<h2>Your payout is on the way 💸</h2>
<p>We've initiated a payout of <strong>{{formatCurrency amount currency}}</strong> to your connected bank account.</p>

<div style="background: #ecfdf5; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0;">
  <p style="margin: 4px 0;"><strong>Amount:</strong> {{formatCurrency amount currency}}</p>
  <p style="margin: 4px 0;"><strong>Payout ID:</strong> {{payoutId}}</p>
  {{#if transferId}}
  <p style="margin: 4px 0;"><strong>Transfer ID:</strong> {{transferId}}</p>
  {{/if}}
</div>

<p>Funds typically arrive in your bank account within 2–7 business days.</p>

<p>
  <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="button">View Payout Details</a>
</p>